{
  "camel_example": "aliyun dataworks-public ListNodes --region cn-hangzhou --Recurrence Normal --PageSize 10 --ContainerId 860438872620113XXXX --PageNumber 1 --ProjectId 12345 --RerunMode Allowed --Scene DataworksProject --Name test",
  "cmd_full_name": "dataworks-public list-nodes",
  "cmd_name": "list-nodes",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Retrieves a paginated list of data development nodes that can be filtered by specified criteria",
  "description_zh": "分页获取数据开发节点列表，也可以通过筛选条件对列表进行筛选查询",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun dataworks-public list-nodes --project-id 12345 --scene DataworksProject --container-id 860438872620113XXXX --recurrence Normal --rerun-mode Allowed --name test --page-number 1 --page-size 10 --api-version 2024-05-18 --region cn-hangzhou",
  "method": "GET",
  "multi_version": true,
  "name": "ListNodes",
  "operation": {
    "action": "ListNodes",
    "api_style": "RPC",
    "api_version": "2024-05-18",
    "method": "GET",
    "operation_type": "read",
    "protocol": "HTTPS",
    "system_operation_type": "list",
    "url": ""
  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "example": "12345",
      "help_en": "The ID of the DataWorks workspace. To find this ID, log in to the DataWorks console (https://workbench.data.aliyun.com/console) and navigate to the workspace configuration page",
      "help_zh": "DataWorks工作空间的ID。您可以登录DataWorks控制台 (https://workbench.data.aliyun.com/console)，进入工作空间配置页面获取工作空间ID",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "project_id",
      "options": [
        "--project-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ProjectId",
      "required": true,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "DataworksProject",
      "help_en": "The context for filtering nodes. In data development, this corresponds to the sections in the directory tree on the left. If you omit this parameter, no filtering is applied. Valid values:\n\nDataworksProject: Nodes in the project directory.\n\nDataworksManualWorkflow: manual workflow\n\nDataworksManualTask: manual task",
      "help_zh": "筛选条件：节点所在场景，如未指定则不填写，在数据开发中对应左侧目录树的分区可选值： \n\nDataworksProject 项目目录\n\nDataworksManualWorkflow 手动工作流 \n\nDataworksManualTask 手动任务",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "scene",
      "options": [
        "--scene"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Scene",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "860438872620113XXXX",
      "help_en": "The ID of the container. If you specify this parameter, only nodes in the specified container are returned. This parameter is independent of the resource group (ResourceGroupId).\n\n<notice>\n\nThis parameter is of the Long type in SDK versions earlier than 8.0.0 and of the String type in SDK 8.0.0 and later. This change does not affect SDK usage. The parameter is returned in the type defined for your SDK version. The type change may cause compilation errors only when you upgrade the SDK across version 8.0.0. In this case, you must manually correct the data type.\n\n</notice>",
      "help_zh": "如未指定则不填写，筛选条件：在指定容器内。填写容器ID，与资源组（ResourceGroupId）无关。\n\n<notice>该字段在SDK8.0.0版本之前为Long类型，SDK8.0.0版本及之后为String类型。该变更不影响SDK正常使用，参数仍会按SDK中定义的类型返回。只有在跨8.0.0版本的SDK升级时，类型变更可能会导致项目编译不通过，需要用户手动修正数据类型。></notice>",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "container_id",
      "options": [
        "--container-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ContainerId",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "Normal",
      "help_en": "Filters nodes by their scheduling type. Valid values:\n\nNormal: The node runs as scheduled.\n\nPause: The node is paused and blocks its dependent downstream nodes.\n\nSkip: The node is skipped, and the system immediately returns a success status with a 0-second execution time. This action does not block downstream nodes or consume resources",
      "help_zh": "筛选条件：调度类型可选值： \n\nNormal：正常执行任务。\n\nPause：节点状态被置为暂停，并且会阻塞依赖当前节点的下游节点执行。\n \nSkip：节点状态被置为空跑，系统会直接返回成功（执行时长为0秒），不会阻塞下游节点执行，也不会占用资源",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "recurrence",
      "options": [
        "--recurrence"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Recurrence",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "Allowed",
      "help_en": "The rerun mode. Valid values:\n\nAllowed: The node can be rerun regardless of whether it succeeded or failed.\n\nFailureAllowed: The node can be rerun only if its previous run failed.\n\nDenied: The node cannot be rerun regardless of whether it succeeded or failed",
      "help_zh": "重跑属性，如不指定则不填写。取值如下： \n\nAllowed：运行成功或失败后皆可重跑。\n \nFailureAllowed：运行成功后不可重跑，运行失败后可以重跑。\n \nDenied：运行成功或失败皆不可重跑",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "rerun_mode",
      "options": [
        "--rerun-mode"
      ],
      "raw_name": "RerunMode",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "test",
      "help_en": "The node name. Fuzzy search is supported",
      "help_zh": "节点名称，支持模糊查询",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "name",
      "options": [
        "--name"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Name",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "1",
      "help_en": "The page number of the results to return",
      "help_zh": "请求的数据页数，用于翻页",
      "location": "query",
      "maximum": "2147483647",
      "minimum": "1",
      "name": "page_number",
      "options": [
        "--page-number"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PageNumber",
      "required": false,
